    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Crea'Dogs is a grooming salon at 225 avenue Aristide Briand in Roquebrune-Cap-Martin. Its Instagram account describes it as a dog and cat groomer serving Roquebrune, Menton and Monaco.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>According to the salon's Instagram profile, it is open Tuesday to Saturday, 9am to 1pm and 2pm to 5pm, at the address above. Prices are not published: ask for a quote by phone on 04 93 17 11 45, the number shown on Google Maps.</p>
      <p>Google Maps reports the salon as temporarily closed (data of 05/11/2026), while the Instagram account posted content in October 2026: call before making the trip. The name "Atout Poils" is still associated with this address in some business directories.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: call before you go to confirm the salon is open and to book.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Cap Martin and its coastal path are just a few minutes away, a good idea to extend the outing after grooming.</p>
